<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1949040217"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1623459440"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="幻影"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="はるまきごはん / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="幻影EP-Envy Phantom-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:37.783"><div begin="00:00.311" end="03:37.783"><p begin="00:00.311" end="00:05.532" itunes:key="L1">あなたはだれ？わたしはだれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是谁 我又是谁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa da re wa ta shi wa da re</span></p><p begin="00:20.980" end="00:24.512" itunes:key="L2">あなたはわたしではないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你我不同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa wa ta shi de wa na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:24.513" end="00:28.536" itunes:key="L3">考えていることわからなくて当然<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自然没有办法理解对方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ga e te i ru ko to wa ka ra na ku te to u ze n</span></p><p begin="00:28.537" end="00:30.464" itunes:key="L4">わたし、わたしの気持ちなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我宁愿不明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ta shi no ki mo chi na n te</span></p><p begin="00:30.465" end="00:32.015" itunes:key="L5">わかんなくて良かった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己心之所想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka n na ku te yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:32.016" end="00:33.374" itunes:key="L6">その代わりじゃないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然这并不是我会那样做的替代</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka wa ri ja na i ke do</span></p><p begin="00:33.375" end="00:35.091" itunes:key="L7">その代わりじゃないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然这并不是我会那样做的替代</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka wa ri ja na i ke do</span></p><p begin="00:35.470" end="00:37.484" itunes:key="L8">本当の言葉で話してって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然你随口说了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko to ba de ha na shi te 't te</span></p><p begin="00:37.485" end="00:39.421" itunes:key="L9">気軽に言うけどね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我告诉你真话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ga ru ni i u ke do ne</span></p><p begin="00:39.422" end="00:41.146" itunes:key="L10">誰かと違ってそんな賢明に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不像其他人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka to chi ga 't te</span></p><p begin="00:41.147" end="00:42.893" itunes:key="L11">出来てはないからね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样聪明啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ke n me i ni de ki te wa na i ka ra ne</span></p><p begin="00:42.894" end="00:44.908" itunes:key="L12">後悔するってわかっている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u ka i su ru 't te wa ka 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:44.909" end="00:46.115" itunes:key="L13">わかってるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某天我会后悔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ru ke do</span></p><p begin="00:46.116" end="00:49.191" itunes:key="L14">わたし影を作っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在创造着幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ka ge wo tsu ku 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:50.637" end="00:54.027" itunes:key="L15">あなたはだれ？わたしはだれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是谁 我又是谁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa da re wa ta shi wa da re</span></p><p begin="00:54.028" end="00:58.031" itunes:key="L16">本当の心は何処に在るの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真正的心在哪里呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko ko ro wa do ko ni a ru no</span></p><p begin="00:58.032" end="01:01.516" itunes:key="L17">あなたはだれ？わたしはだれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是谁 我又是谁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa da re wa ta shi wa da re</span></p><p begin="01:01.517" end="01:08.386" itunes:key="L18">ぼんやり頭は考えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脑里的答案依稀不清</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo n ya ri a ta ma wa ka n ga e ta</span></p><p begin="01:08.387" end="01:09.729" itunes:key="L19">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="01:09.730" end="01:15.995" itunes:key="L20">わたしは幻の影になったの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="01:15.996" end="01:17.213" itunes:key="L21">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="01:17.214" end="01:20.208" itunes:key="L22">わたしは幻の影になったの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="01:24.288" end="01:27.964" itunes:key="L23">三番目の影が走り去って行った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第三个幻影跑着远去了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ba n me no ka ge ga ha shi ri sa 't te i 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:27.965" end="01:30.422" itunes:key="L24">わたし、瞳はふたつなんてものじゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只有两只眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi hi to mi wa fu ta tsu na n te mo no ja</span></p><p begin="01:30.423" end="01:31.580" itunes:key="L25">足りなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然并不足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:31.581" end="01:32.893" itunes:key="L26">その代わりじゃないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然这并不是我会那样做的替代</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka wa ri ja na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:32.894" end="01:34.576" itunes:key="L27">その代わりじゃないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然这并不是我会那样做的替代</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka wa ri ja na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:35.246" end="01:36.935" itunes:key="L28">あなたの瞳に夜を描いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想把黑夜画进你的瞳孔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no hi to mi ni yo ru wo e ga i te</span></p><p begin="01:36.936" end="01:38.615" itunes:key="L29">眠って欲しかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你安眠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu 't te ho shi ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:38.616" end="01:40.727" itunes:key="L30">揺らめく後ろの髪の輪郭を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经记住了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra me ku u shi ro no ka mi no ri n ka ku wo</span></p><p begin="01:40.728" end="01:42.691" itunes:key="L31">全部覚えていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你摇曳后发的轮廓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu o bo e te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:42.692" end="01:44.494" itunes:key="L32">後悔するってわかっている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u ka i su ru 't te wa ka 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:44.495" end="01:45.643" itunes:key="L33">わかってるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某天我会后悔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ru ke do</span></p><p begin="01:45.644" end="01:48.677" itunes:key="L34">また影を作っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在创造着幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ka ge wo tsu ku 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:50.131" end="01:53.598" itunes:key="L35">話をきいて話をきいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听我说 听我说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na shi wo ki i te ha na shi wo ki i te</span></p><p begin="01:53.600" end="01:57.505" itunes:key="L36">本当のわたしはここに居るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真正的我就在这里啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no wa ta shi wa ko ko ni i ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:57.506" end="02:01.055" itunes:key="L37">あなたはずっとあなたはずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些日子以来你一直</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa zu 't to a na ta wa zu 't to</span></p><p begin="02:01.056" end="02:08.175" itunes:key="L38">わたしの影と遊んでいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都在和我的影子玩耍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no ka ge to a so n de i ru</span></p><p begin="02:08.176" end="02:09.276" itunes:key="L39">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也是幻影啊幻影啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mo ma bo ro shi no ka ge yo ka ge yo</span></p><p begin="02:09.277" end="02:15.656" itunes:key="L40">あなたも幻の影よ影よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也是幻影啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mo ma bo ro shi no ka ge yo ka ge yo</span></p><p begin="02:15.657" end="02:16.776" itunes:key="L41">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也是幻影啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mo ma bo ro shi no ka ge yo ka ge yo</span></p><p begin="02:16.777" end="02:21.456" itunes:key="L42">あなたも幻の影よ影よ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mo ma bo ro shi no ka ge yo ka ge yo</span></p><p begin="02:22.878" end="02:33.433" itunes:key="L43">影よ 影よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幻影 幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ge yo ka ge yo</span></p><p begin="02:34.543" end="02:38.331" itunes:key="L44">わたしのせいでわたしのせいで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是我的错</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no se i de wa ta shi no se i de</span></p><p begin="02:38.332" end="02:42.133" itunes:key="L45">本当の言葉が消えてしまうから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">导致真正的话语开始消逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko to ba ga ki e te shi ma u ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:42.134" end="02:45.675" itunes:key="L46">あなたはだれ？わたしはだれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是谁 我又是谁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa da re wa ta shi wa da re</span></p><p begin="02:45.676" end="02:49.527" itunes:key="L47">幽し影に尋ねていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我向幽幽的影子询问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka so ke shi ka ge ni ta zu ne te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:49.528" end="02:53.089" itunes:key="L48">あなたにとってあなたにとって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对你来说 对你来说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni to 't te a na ta ni to 't te</span></p><p begin="02:53.090" end="02:56.992" itunes:key="L49">本当の心はどれがよかったの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的这些心脏 哪个才是真实的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko ko ro wa do re ga yo ka 't ta no</span></p><p begin="02:56.993" end="03:07.587" itunes:key="L50">幻想のわたしも意外と紙一影<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幻想的我和真正的我之间的差别 意外地轻如薄纸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge n so u no wa ta shi mo i ga i to ka mi hi to e i</span></p><p begin="03:07.694" end="03:08.781" itunes:key="L51">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="03:08.782" end="03:15.205" itunes:key="L52">わたしは幻の影になったの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="03:15.206" end="03:16.209" itunes:key="L53">Living dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我变成了幻影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p><p begin="03:16.210" end="03:37.783" itunes:key="L54">わたしは幻の影になったの<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ma bo ro shi no ka ge ni na 't ta no</span></p></div></body></tt>